cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or implement this specification, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Ore Format"
abstract: "Ore is a format for executable notes: Markdown files whose front matter says ore: true and whose ore:<kind> cells run in dependency order and write their outputs back into the note, within permissions the note declares."
authors:
